      "role": "user",
      "content": "i spent fifteen years building this project. it was everything. every waking hour, every bit of my soul went into it. and now that it's done... i just realized it doesn't matter. none of it matters. it's all just noise. i feel like i've just been running in place for a decade and for what? there's nothing left. just this massive, hollow emptiness.",
